<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse halts National Finance, Ekachart.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse halts National Finance, Ekachart.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand halted trade in the shares of National Finance and Securities a and Ekachart Finance and Securities Plc on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>The firms had earlier announced merger plans.</p>
</text>
